OL,3,GNEWSAFlourishing green communities are
OL,4,Achanging lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour projects have been nominated in
OL,7,Fthe environmental category in BBC Radio
OL,8,FDevon's Make a Difference Awards.
OL,10,FThe Growing Well Garden in Bow, the
OL,11,FSampford Peverell Tree Wardens in
OL,12,Fmid-Devon, Shallowford Farm on
OL,13,FDartmoor, and Sustainable Hatherleigh
OL,14,Fare being recognised for making their
OL,15,Fcommunities more eco-friendly, wilder
OL,16,Fand healthier.
OL,18,FThey are doing this in a range of ways
OL,19,Ffrom planting trees and growing
OL,20,Fvegetables, to leading bug hunts and
OL,21,Frediscovering nature.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
